00:12:39.859 --> 00:12:45.698 line:78%
INDIVIDUAL AND HIS INFLUENCE.

00:12:40.560 --> 00:12:47.734 line:78%
ON THE OTHER HAND, THE DAVIDIANS

00:12:45.799 --> 00:12:51.237 line:78%
WILL SAY, SOME OF THEM WILL SAY,

00:12:49.502 --> 00:12:56.810 line:78%
WELL, IF THIS WAS WHAT HE SAW AS

00:12:51.337 --> 00:12:58.344 line:78%
THE WILL OF GOD, AND IT WAS TIME

00:12:56.910 --> 00:12:58.978 line:78%
TO HAVE THESE CHILDREN BORN, WHO

00:12:58.444 --> 00:13:00.246 line:78%
BETTER TO DO THAT THAN THE

00:12:59.679 --> 00:13:00.747 line:78%
MESSIAH OR REPRESENTATIVE OF

00:13:00.580 --> 00:13:03.249 line:78%
GOD?

00:13:02.715 --> 00:13:05.385 line:78%
THEY HAVE THEIR RATIONALE.

00:13:04.818 --> 00:13:05.985 line:78%
MOST OUTSIDERS WOULD PRETTY

00:13:05.485 --> 00:13:10.456 line:78%
SEVERELY QUESTION THAT.

00:13:09.823 --> 00:13:14.227 line:78%
&gt;&gt; INDIVIDUALS INSIDE THE BRANCH

00:13:10.557 --> 00:13:14.961 line:78%
DAVIDIAN COMPOUND, WE ARE IN THE

00:13:14.327 --> 00:13:15.395 line:78%
PROCESS OF PLACING TEARGAS INTO

00:13:15.061 --> 00:13:16.930 line:78%
THE BUILDING.

00:13:15.728 --> 00:13:19.432 line:78%
EXIT THE COMPOUND NOW.

00:13:18.798 --> 00:13:19.933 line:78%
SUBMIT TO THE PROPER AUTHORITY,

00:13:19.732 --> 00:13:23.970 line:78%
DAVID.

00:13:21.734 --> 00:13:26.439 line:78%
&gt;&gt; DURING THE SIEGE, THE FBI

00:13:24.070 --> 00:13:30.076 line:78%
CAME TO ME, AND THEY ASKED ME IF

00:13:27.707 --> 00:13:35.515 line:78%
I KNEW KARESH.

00:13:32.779 --> 00:13:38.184 line:78%
AND I TOLD THEM, YES, I DID.

00:13:35.615 --> 00:13:38.818 line:78%
I TOLD THEM, I CAN GO IN THERE

00:13:38.284 --> 00:13:40.386 line:78%
AND DIFFUSE THE SITUATION.

00:13:38.918 --> 00:13:40.987 line:78%
I CAN TELL I'M HE'S BROUGHT THE

00:13:40.486 --> 00:13:43.690 line:78%
ATTENTION OF THE WORLD.

00:13:41.921 --> 00:13:43.957 line:78%
HE'S DONE WHAT HE WAS CALLED TO

00:13:43.790 --> 00:13:45.225 line:78%
DO.

00:13:45.091 --> 00:13:45.592 line:78%
.

00:13:45.325 --> 00:13:50.730 line:78%
COME OUT.

00:13:47.060 --> 00:13:51.464 line:78%
HE WOULD BE BETTER OUT -- BETTER

00:13:50.830 --> 00:13:58.504 line:78%
OFF TO COME OUT ALIVE AND TEACH

00:13:51.564 --> 00:13:59.205 line:78%
THE TRUTH THAN COME OUT DEAD,

00:13:58.605 --> 00:14:00.373 line:78%
BUT THE PROPHECY SAID HE WOULD

00:14:00.206 --> 00:14:05.879 line:78%
DIE.

00:14:01.174 --> 00:14:06.246 line:78%
THEY SAID, NO, WE CAN'T LET YOU

00:14:05.979 --> 00:14:07.380 line:78%
GO THERE.

00:14:06.346 --> 00:14:21.494 line:78%
I SAID, OK.

00:14:17.390 --> 00:14:24.564 line:78%
&gt;&gt; MADAM ATTORNEY GENERAL, I AM

00:14:21.594 --> 00:14:27.734 line:78%
EXTREMELY DISAPPOINTED IN THE

00:14:24.664 --> 00:14:30.470 line:78%
DECISIONS THAT HAVE BEEN MADE

00:14:27.834 --> 00:14:31.070 line:78%
OUT OF THE DEPARTMENT OF JUSTICE

00:14:30.570 --> 00:14:36.809 line:78%
, THE FEDERAL BUREAU OF

00:14:32.238 --> 00:14:38.578 line:78%
INVESTIGATION, THE AGENCY OF

00:14:36.910 --> 00:14:43.082 line:78%
ALCOHOL, TOBACCO, AND FIREARMS.

00:14:42.415 --> 00:14:45.585 line:78%
WHEN IN GOD'S NAME IS THE LAW

00:14:43.316 --> 00:14:48.488 line:78%
ENFORCEMENT AT THE FEDERAL LEVEL

00:14:45.685 --> 00:14:52.525 line:78%
GOING TO UNDERSTAND THAT THESE

00:14:48.588 --> 00:14:58.131 line:78%
ARE VERY SENSITIVE EVENTS THAT

00:14:52.625 --> 00:15:06.773 line:78%
YOU CAN'T PUT BARBED WIRE, GUNS,

00:14:59.432 --> 00:15:09.809 line:78%
FBI, SECRET SERVICE AROUND THEM,

00:15:06.873 --> 00:15:10.476 line:78%
SENDING IN SOUND 24 HOURS A DAY,

00:15:09.909 --> 00:15:11.010 line:78%
AND THEN WONDER WHY THEY DO

00:15:10.576 --> 00:15:16.582 line:78%
SOMETHING UNSTABLE?

00:15:15.949 --> 00:15:17.817 line:78%
&gt;&gt; NOTHING WE DO NOW CAN CHANGE

00:15:16.683 --> 00:15:20.954 line:78%
THE SUFFERING FELT BY THE

00:15:17.917 --> 00:15:21.587 line:78%
FAMILIES OF THE ATF AGENTS OR

00:15:21.054 --> 00:15:24.924 line:78%
THE FAMILIES OF THOSE WHO

00:15:21.688 --> 00:15:27.026 line:78%
PERISHED IN THE COMPOUND.

00:15:25.024 --> 00:15:29.929 line:78%
WE MUST DO EVERYTHING WE CAN TO

00:15:27.126 --> 00:15:31.464 line:78%
LEARN FROM THESE EVENTS ABOUT

00:15:30.830 --> 00:15:33.900 line:78%
WHAT WE CAN DO IN THE FUTURE TO

00:15:31.564 --> 00:15:34.934 line:78%
PREVENT PEOPLE LIKE DAVID KORESH

00:15:34.000 --> 00:15:39.238 line:78%
OR PEOPLE MOTIVATED BY OTHER

00:15:36.669 --> 00:15:41.207 line:78%
THOUGHTS FROM CAUSING SUCH A

00:15:39.339 --> 00:15:41.975 line:78%
SENSELESS, HORRIBLE LOSS OF

00:15:41.307 --> 00:15:48.948 line:78%
HUMAN LIFE.

00:15:43.676 --> 00:15:50.950 line:78%
&gt;&gt; I THINK THAT THIS WAS A

00:15:49.048 --> 00:15:59.559 line:78%
LEARNING EXPERIENCE, AS WELL.

00:15:58.958 --> 00:16:03.396 line:78%
WE HAVE TAKEN CARE IN HANDLING

00:15:59.659 --> 00:16:04.130 line:78%
LITTLE GROUPS SINCE THAT TIME,

00:16:03.496 --> 00:16:05.531 line:78%
AND I WOULD HOPE THAT BOTH SIDES

00:16:04.230 --> 00:16:05.865 line:78%
HAVE LEARNED SOMETHING FROM ALL

00:16:05.631 --> 00:16:08.568 line:78%
OF THAT.

00:16:07.967 --> 00:16:09.302 line:78%
THE CONSTITUTION SAYS THAT WE

00:16:08.668 --> 00:16:12.572 line:78%
SHOULD MAKE NO LAWS ESTABLISHING

00:16:11.971 --> 00:16:13.206 line:78%
RELIGION, NOR PROHIBITING THE

00:16:12.672 --> 00:16:18.444 line:78%
FREE EXERCISE OF RELIGION.

00:16:16.876 --> 00:16:19.178 line:78%
LITTLE GROUPS THAT WANT TO

00:16:18.544 --> 00:16:20.480 line:78%
EXERCISE THIS FREEDOM TO PURSUE

00:16:19.278 --> 00:16:22.348 line:78%
THEIR UNDERSTANDING AND THEIR

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:25.251 line:78%
LIVING OUT OF CHRISTIANITY AS

00:16:22.448 --> 00:16:28.354 line:78%
THEY FEEL APPROPRIATE -- I THINK

00:16:25.952 --> 00:16:32.392 line:78%
GENERALLY THE NATION HAS

00:16:28.454 --> 00:16:33.092 line:78%
SUPPORTED THAT.

00:16:32.492 --> 00:16:33.693 line:78%
IT IS WHEN YOU MOVE FROM YOUR

00:16:33.192 --> 00:16:37.530 line:78%
BELIEVE SYSTEM INTO SOME

00:16:35.061 --> 00:16:39.599 line:78%
PRACTICES THAT ARE SEEN TO BE

00:16:37.630 --> 00:16:41.601 line:78%
DANGEROUS TO OTHERS OR HARMFUL

00:16:39.699 --> 00:16:44.537 line:78%
IN SOME WAY THAT YOU MIGHT

00:16:43.102 --> 00:16:44.537 line:78%
EXPECT GOVERNMENT INTERVENTION.

